# Phase 5: Dashboard & Admin Polish

## Goal
Build the calendar inventory dashboard, add summary statistics, polish the admin UX, and integrate email sending.

## Build Order

### 1. Calendar Inventory Grid (`/admin/dashboard`)
- Filter bar: calendar edition (select), year (select)
- 12-column grid (one per month) showing ad slots
- Each cell in the grid = one ad slot for that month
- Day-type slots: numbered 1-35, show which contact/company owns each
- Non-day-type slots: show as a separate section per month
- Color-coding: assign a unique color per advertiser (contact)
  - Use a deterministic color from contact ID hash
  - Legend at bottom showing color → company mapping
- Click any occupied slot → link to purchase detail page
- Empty slots clearly indicated for quick visual scanning

### 2. Summary Stats Cards
- Row of 4 stat cards at top of dashboard:
  - **Total Revenue:** sum of all purchase `net` values for selected edition+year (computed)
  - **Collection Rate:** (total amountPaid / total net) × 100, shown as percentage
  - **Outstanding Balance:** total net - total amountPaid
  - **Late Payments:** count of scheduled payments where `isScheduledPaymentLate() === true`
- All values COMPUTED from billing helpers, never stored

### 3. Email Integration
- Resend API setup in `src/lib/email/resend.ts`
- React Email templates: clean, professional, branded
- Invoice email: triggered from purchase detail page "Email Invoice" button
- Statement email: triggered from contact detail page "Email Statement" button
- PDF attached as email attachment (generate → attach → send)
- Success/error toast notifications after send

### 4. Print Optimization
- Print-specific CSS: `@media print` styles
- Calendar inventory: full page grid layout for printing
- Invoices: clean single-page layout
- Statements: professional multi-page layout
- Hide navigation, buttons, and chrome in print view
- `window.print()` trigger from "Print" buttons

### 5. Admin UX Polish
- **Breadcrumbs:** consistent breadcrumb navigation on all sub-pages
- **Active nav states:** highlight current section in sidebar
- **Mobile responsive:** sidebar → Sheet on mobile, tables → card layout on small screens
- **Loading states:** Skeleton components for every data-loading view
- **Error boundaries:** at route segment level with retry button
- **Empty states:** friendly messages + action button when no data exists
- **Toast notifications:** success/error feedback on all mutations (use shadcn Sonner or Toast)
- **Keyboard shortcuts:** Escape closes dialogs, Enter submits forms
- **Consistent spacing:** 6-unit padding, 4-unit gaps throughout

## Validation Checklist
- [ ] Dashboard shows correct slot occupancy for all months
- [ ] Stats match manual calculation from billing data
- [ ] Email sends successfully with PDF attachment
- [ ] Print view produces clean output without UI chrome
- [ ] Mobile layout is usable on phone-width screens
- [ ] All loading/error states display correctly
